{"title":"2000 IMO Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Alternative_Ending\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternative Ending</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/c/acc6d9a6172d35127b6cb37ea92192caf7029a54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b, c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> be positive real numbers with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/5/175cbe9f31961b36429a43d532d7bf12d2342d13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$abc=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"57\" height=\"13\" />. Show that\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/6/e96e8028ff8719b9a661de10c0cb70fc7b43ca67.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left( a-1+\\frac{1}{b} \\right)\\left( b-1+\\frac{1}{c} \\right)\\left( c-1+\\frac{1}{a} \\right) \\le 1\\]\" width=\"339\" height=\"43\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There exist positive reals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/2/842c7273008239c636c25856b7df08504709e043.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{x}{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/7/bd77c66418a95776e13e65769c5ec8cc6b246010.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\frac{y}{z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"47\" height=\"34\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/e/eaed0a9011bf6337509e709e8a1568b2057bea9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = \\frac{z}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"48\" height=\"34\" />. The inequality then rewrites as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/d/65d590ef6465d23c4bb734a0d8868c815358315c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left(\\frac{x-y+z}{y}\\right)\\left(\\frac{y-z+x}{z}\\right)\\left(\\frac{z-x+y}{x}\\right)\\leq 1\\]\" width=\"346\" height=\"43\" />\nor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/b/a3b666d38d4e1e88ba32217baccc04455acf9398.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x-y+z)(y-z+x)(z-x+y)\\leq xyz.\\]\" width=\"319\" height=\"18\" /> Set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/c/3ccd81f22f4eea93ee8f91b5bee2f7e1f39e7ad9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p=x-y+z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"109\" height=\"16\" />,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/0/160963061400324a5c9c360736a63f68013a8f73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q=y-z+x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"108\" height=\"16\" />,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/3/ec35b38fdcb8301dd2c2b1d93012da74817fdd3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=z-x+y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"108\" height=\"16\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/7/3978bbd0d246e2d945de2d0a5608e804255ca2d2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[8pqr\\leq(p+q)(q+r)(r+p).\\]\" width=\"225\" height=\"18\" />\nSince at most one of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/7/3674de20e2b78b5790ea714b9dcaa11af6aa2340.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p,q,r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"13\" /> can be negative (if 2 or more are negative, then one of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5b29b358e825defa3e11b7d903d43ec31e5909a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> will become negative), for all positive we apply AM-GM, for one negative we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/7/5f77eadcde74149a46e12212bab7c7a400776b7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$LHS&lt;0&lt;RHS$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"143\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternative_Ending\">Alternative Ending</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Alternative Ending\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>The inequality <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/0/ce0704ca5433f44c7d3270759ec7732dc40a2385.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-y+z)(y-z+x)(z-x+y)\\leq xyz.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"324\" height=\"20\" /> is trivial via Schur's.\n</p><p>~Pinotation (I did not make solution 1)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/-JyUrRq18BU?si=_kVNesHwbqI4_P9d\">https://youtu.be/-JyUrRq18BU?si=_kVNesHwbqI4_P9d</a> [little-fermat]\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>RoadTo50Mohs, simple and elegant: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/OpPkgOs38ao\">https://youtu.be/OpPkgOs38ao</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_IMO\" title=\"2000 IMO\">2000 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_IMO_Problems\" title=\"2000 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2000 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2000 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2000 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2000 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2000 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2000 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2000 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017065105\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduce